  "seal_metal_source_note": "The 'Observations' section of the De Laurence text assigns seal metals by rank. A footnote remarks that 'probably the Seals of Earls should be made of Iron, and those of Presidents in mixture either of Copper and Silver, or of Silver and Mercury' — otherwise Mars (Iron) is excluded from the list. The metals attributed to the Seven Planets are: Saturn=Lead, Jupiter=Tin, Mars=Iron, Sun=Gold, Venus=Copper, Mercury=Mercury/mixtures, Luna=Silver.",
